### Gateway readiness
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health/readiness

### 상품 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 재고 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventories/SKU-001

### 주문 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUST-001",
  "items": [
    {
      "sku": "SKU-001",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 129000
    }
  ],
  "paymentMethod": "CARD"
}

